# Endpoint provenance

`∀ turn closure: ¬sign_off` · `∀ boot/dispatch prompt: ¬assert_identity_at_agent` (duty is a seat/function, ¬ a persona) · `∀ prose/bus/skills: ¬personal_name(Claude)`.

Naming, best → worst: `web-anthropic` → `anthropic` → `claude.ai` (product label only when that UI is the subject). Bus `from`/`to` are endpoint addresses. Model artifact strings (`claude-opus-…`) and runtime aliases (`claude-web` → `web-anthropic`) remain.

✗ `chain Claude` · `Claude final` ✓ `chain to web-anthropic` · `web-anthropic final`. Doctrine: `decision:identity-doctrine-endpoint-provenance`.
